<title>USA: Tyler Corp makes executive appointments.</title>
<headline>Tyler Corp makes executive appointments.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyler Corp said Friday it named David Tusa as its chief financial officer and Scott Creasman as its controller.</p>
<p>Tusa, the company said, was most recently the senior vice president of finance and administration of Serv-Tech Inc, a provider of services and products for the multiple-processing industries.</p>
<p>Tyler, a maker of products for fund-raising programs and automotive parts, said that Creasman was most recently the controller of Brink's Home Security Inc, a provider of home security services in the U.S.</p>
</text>
